The source code in this repository is the property of RG DEV Industries.

The hymn, Bible and liturgy content shipped with RG-Present is in the public
domain and is not covered by the above. Each content pack records its own
source in content-src/<pack>/manifest.json and CHANGELOG.md:

  King James Version                   public domain
  The Open Hymnal (2014.06)            openhymnal.org, freely distributable
  The Christian Hymn Book (1870)       Project Gutenberg #46041
  The Otterbein Hymnal (1890)          Project Gutenberg #16455
  Wesleyan Methodist Hymn Book (1869)  archive.org/details/wesleyanmethodis00wesl
  Sacred Songs & Solos (Sankey)        archive.org, public domain
  Iuku ria Rwimbo (Kimeru)             transcribed from a supplied slide deck

Bible translations that are still in copyright, such as the NIV or HCSB, are
NOT included in this repository or in the installer. They are imported by each
church from files it is licensed to use.
